  <h1>Privacy Policy — Sangha Friend Tracker (Bodhisattva's Way v3.0)</h1>
  <p><strong>Android Package ID:</strong> <code>cloud.sbanerjee.sanghatracker</code> &bull; <a href="/webhook/bsg-sangha-app">&larr; Back to Live App</a></p>
